   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Every task pulls the same immutable image digest from ECR and reads its database URL from Secrets Manager.\nThe console and both workers also use S3 and Bedrock; the reaper only touches CockroachDB.\nCloudWatch collects logs, metrics, and four alarms. There is no NAT Gateway anywhere.",
   "originalText": "Every task pulls the same immutable image digest from ECR and reads its database URL from Secrets Manager.\nThe console and both workers also use S3 and Bedrock; the reaper only touches CockroachDB.\nCloudWatch collects logs, metrics, and four alarms. There is no NAT Gateway anywhere.",
